    "assumptions": [
      "Users must register and login to place orders",
      "Payment processing is handled via third-party integration (e.g., Stripe)",
      "Delivery addresses are stored as text; geocoding handled by application layer",
      "Stock quantities are decremented when orders are placed",
      "Order status transitions: Pending -> Processing -> Out for Delivery -> Delivered",
      "Delivery drivers are users with role 'Delivery Driver'",
      "Each order can only be assigned to one driver at a time",
      "Prices are stored in USD with 2 decimal places"
